We sincerely thank you for your thoughtful and constructive feedback. In our rebuttal, we have provided detailed responses to your major concerns:

- The necessity of our two-stage design, supplemented with new ablation studies on the distributional modeling settings;  
- Comparison of training/inference time consumption across methods;  
- The benefits of explicitly modeling the full return distribution rather than only its expectation;  
- Theoretical justification for the two-stage critic convergence.

We would be most grateful if you could take a moment to review our response. We hope these clarifications sufficiently address your concerns, and we remain available to answer any further questions you may have.
